The nginx build in nginx/ comes from
https://github.com/chainguard-forks/ingress-nginx (images/nginx/rootfs)
at commit 29e7c87140a9d88ffd3cf26ff07852bb81dc0a4a, which continues the build of
https://github.com/kubernetes/ingress-nginx. The final stage of Dockerfile is
adapted from images/nginx/rootfs/Dockerfile at that commit and from
rootfs/Dockerfile of kubernetes/ingress-nginx controller-v1.15.1.
