nginx/patches/ is unchanged. Patches 00 to 34 are the ones
kubernetes/ingress-nginx shipped. Patches 35 to 58 are backports of nginx/nginx
commits and each file names its CVE and commit. Two of them name a commit of
nginx/nginx pull request 1474 that is on no branch. The same changes were
merged as:

  38_nginx-1.27.1-CVE-2026-42055.patch  26d824ec3a2f819300edce0ab3b055751c9843ff
  39_nginx-1.27.1-CVE-2026-48142.patch  319a0bff157b15d9061f4712b2edbe6fdd2dee66

nginx/build.sh is changed in four places:

  1. The OpenTelemetry module is compiled against the patched nginx tree. The
     original downloaded stock nginx over plain HTTP for that step, and
     patch 37 changes the layout of ngx_http_request_t.
  2. nlohmann/json, which opentelemetry-cpp clones during its build, is pinned
     to the commit of v3.11.3.
  3. ModSecurity v3.0.14 is checked against its commit after checkout.
  4. OWASP CRS v4.22.0 is checked against its commit after clone.
